### Variável com a URL base da API
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Criar um Desenvolvedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/developer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Ana Silva",
    "salary": 5000.00,
    "programming_language": "Python"
}

###

### 2. Criar um Gerente
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Carlos Mendes",
    "salary": 10000.00,
    "team_size": 5
}

###

### 3. Listar todos os funcionários (A Mágica do Polimorfismo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Accept: application/json